HI Michele/ list,
did you ever resolve this? I seem to be having the same/ a similar issue fitting a detection function using ddf to binned data -
> gof_ds(gu.hn.null)

Error in if (model$meta.data$binned) { : argument is of length zero

> gu.hn.null$meta.data$binned
[1] TRUE

On Thursday, August 24, 2017 at 5:50:34 AM UTC+1, Michele Thums wrote:
> Hi Everyone, I have just started to get this error message when trying to plot goodness of fit on my detection function:
> Error in if (model$meta.data$binned) { : argument is of length zero
> I have checked and there are no NAs in the dataset and even I am re-running code and data that I have run previously with no error message.
> Any ideas?
> Cheers,
> Michele

