Hello
I am doing a population density work of Crypturellus noctivagus, I travel a 3.3 km transect, but I am having a problem in the analysis because the shortest detection distance is 100 meters, the species is very skittish and does not approach the transect, there is any R package for cases like mine or to ease this false negativity in detection?
Thank you very much

